{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲较清楚地抓住了“眼前安慰减弱—余温仍在—独自体会美好—快乐显出孤单”的因果转折，也保留了安静中仍想亲近的拉扯；但“热切退下”主要是概括，身体如何先发生变化、他如何调整自己并因此改变感受，交代得不够具体。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙更明确地解释了不急于求回应、允许感受保持矛盾如何使他安静地留在自己的体验中，并写出了心紧后回到温柔、快乐尚未结束便开始留恋，以及无法完全共享彼此感受如何使温暖转为孤单的机制；不足是H/M编号脱离外部定义后不能独立说明因果，且部分心理设定属于合理阐释而非听感本身能够证实的事实。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙不仅保留了甲关于余温、独自体会与孤单并存的核心，还更具体地交代了情绪转折、身体反应及不急于求取答案这一应对方式如何反过来改变感受，因此在题目指定的因果解释维度上至少不逊于甲。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6884bd3b-98b6-41ac-b3e9-0ac9319e67c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134802437620Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:48:49.355146+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "79612fa1222ade88711b43208dda7d4650bc159b24da1754a35c4541ddee81cb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha